WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.460
Be careful, huh?

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:13.820
Thank you.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.160
Shoot him!

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.300
The world is at your feet

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.020
Michael,

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:36.020
do us proud!

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:37.780
You are going to become a doctor?

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:39.840
Yes, it's my passion.

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:45.240
Christopher Myers.

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:48.180
Chris is a star reporter for the "Associated Press".

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:51.060
A toast, to old friends and new!

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:53.480
Bravo!

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:57.760
Ana is a fine woman, Michael.

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:59.460
You make me feel like I'm home.

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:01.780
She is very fond of you, it's obvious.

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:10.000
It's very dangerous for our meetings right now.

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:12.320
I want to get you out of here.

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.900
If it's not safe for me, then it's not safe for any of my people.

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:19.700
What is this "Associated Press" thing here?

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:21.700
Reporting on the war.

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:23.700
There is no war here.

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:33.100
No one here is safe.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.800
I have to get us out of here before there's no time left.

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:44.800
I was told that you're organising the escape route.

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:46.320
How can I help?

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:48.140
Ana!

00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:54.340
Do you love him?

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:00.920
Michael! Run!

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:06.500
You trust no one.

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:09.400
Chris?

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:21.240
We will build a future together.

